crates/cli/src/main.rs	2	the CLI entry publishes --auto-fetch and --set KEY=VALUE overrides at start-up, before any worker thread exists
crates/cli/src/supply.rs	2	the CLI's weight supply points the loaders it is about to run at the files it fetched (their environment contract), single-threaded, before loading
crates/npu/src/openvino/real.rs	1	LD_LIBRARY_PATH must contain the runtime's directory before the process dlopens it; the dynamic loader reads only the environment
